  "source": "one-continuous-master",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "line-01",
      "text": "A circus owner bought Donkey Pinocchio and trained him through punishment.",
      "start": 0.383,
      "end": 4.747
    },
    {
      "id": "line-02",
      "text": "Soon the animal performed bows, dances, and dangerous jumps before crowds.",
      "start": 4.747,
      "end": 11.328
    },
    {
      "id": "line-03",
      "text": "During one bright performance, Pinocchio recognized the Blue Fairy in the audience.",
      "start": 11.328,
      "end": 16.983
    },
    {
      "id": "line-04",
      "text": "He tried to call her name, but his mouth produced only a donkey's bray.",
      "start": 16.983,
      "end": 22.191
    },
    {
      "id": "line-05",
      "text": "Confused and distracted, Pinocchio missed a jump and injured one leg.",
      "start": 22.191,
      "end": 27.635
    },
    {
      "id": "line-06",
      "text": "The circus owner immediately sold the lame donkey for almost nothing.",
      "start": 27.635,
      "end": 32.91
    },
    {
      "id": "line-07",
      "text": "His next owner cared only about using the skin for a drumhead.",
      "start": 32.91,
      "end": 37.145
    },
    {
      "id": "line-08",
      "text": "The man tied a heavy stone to Pinocchio and dropped him underwater.",
      "start": 37.145,
      "end": 42.739
    },
    {
      "id": "line-09",
      "text": "Hungry fish consumed the donkey covering while the protected wooden body remained.",
      "start": 42.739,
      "end": 48.413
    },
    {
      "id": "line-10",
      "text": "When the rope rose, the surprised buyer found a living marionette instead.",
      "start": 48.413,
      "end": 54.47
    },
    {
      "id": "line-11",
      "text": "Pinocchio slipped free and explained that the Fairy had protected him.",
      "start": 54.47,
      "end": 59.221
    },
    {
      "id": "line-12",
      "text": "While he swam away, an azure Goat called from a white rock.",
      "start": 59.221,
      "end": 64.895
    },
    {
      "id": "line-13",
      "text": "Before he could reach safety, the Terrible Shark appeared nearby.",
      "start": 64.895,
      "end": 69.581
    },
    {
      "id": "line-14",
      "text": "Its mouth opened like a cave and pulled the swimmer inward.",
      "start": 69.581,
      "end": 74.658
    },
    {
      "id": "line-15",
      "text": "Pinocchio was swallowed before he could change direction.",
      "start": 74.658,
      "end": 78.332
    },
    {
      "id": "line-16",
      "text": "In the darkness, a large Tunny explained that escape seemed impossible.",
      "start": 78.332,
      "end": 84.005
    }
  ],
